<title>JAPAN: Osaka shinkin banks to announce merger at 0300 GMT.</title>
<headline>Osaka shinkin banks to announce merger at 0300 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two unlisted regional trust banks, Osaka City Shinkin Bank and Osaka Chuo Shinkin Bank, will announce their merger at around 0300 GMT on Tuesday, a Osaka City Shinkin Bank official said.</p>
</text>
